<H2>
Geography Cyberworkers</H2>
<IMG SRC="gif/jesse1.gif" HEIGHT=223 WIDTH=233> <B>JESSE, Lab Mascot</B>

<P>N&eacute;e Commera (w. 22 October 1989, s. Crimson Falcon, d. Sports
Affair). Jesse retired to Austin after a successful racing career in Wisconsin
and Florida. She now makes her home in Lafayette, Colorado.&nbsp; For information
about adopting ex-racing greyhounds contact Greyhound Pets of America at
(800) 366-1472. Adoption information is also available at <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/Heartland/Plains/5006/GHadopt.html">Greyhound
Adoption Group Pages Hall of Fame,</A> Greyhound Pets of America <A HREF="http://www.greyhoundog.org/index.html">California
Adoption Center</A>, and <A HREF="http://www.usadog.org/">USA Defenders
of Greyhounds </A>.&nbsp;
